  "l_3_degree_le_3": "rank_2, rank_3, HF_2, HF_3 exact constants (n13: 87/1166, 214/1159; n15: 89/1210; n17: 91/1254). fall_3 varies one-sidedly: UNSAT at the floor (108 / 112 / 117), a subset of SAT above it. Fall AUC 0.745 / 0.627 / 0.808.",
  "l_3_signal_source": "every SAT instance above the floor has a DEGENERATE planted witness (X_i = X_j or X_1=X_2=X_3); at n=15 all 28 SAT instances with three distinct base points sit exactly at the UNSAT floor (fall_3 = 112). At n=13 and n=17 the generator planted only degenerate witnesses (V has too few curve abscissae). Signal = witness degeneracy, not satisfiability; frequency among genuine decompositions is O(3/2^l).",
